  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Devolution in Kenya 2018-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen devolved governance in Kenya with a focus on the eight Northern Frontier Counties (FCDC) during the period 2018 to 2020.  The key objectives include support to performance management (PFM), public financial management (PFM) and citizen participation in improving service delivery.  This project shall also strengthen the coordination of multi-UN agency initiatives on devolution for FCDC counties.</narrative>
  </description>
